            <div xml:id="d284">

                <pb facs="0425" n="415" sameAs="frus:frus1945v07/pg415"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/6–1745: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harriman</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-06-17T19:00:00+03:00">June 17, 1945—7
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 17—2:25 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2134. Well-informed Soviet source states that there have recently occurred five
                    clashes between Chinese Govt and Chinese Communist forces (to Chungking as 48,
                    repeated Dept as 2134). He says one of these affrays resulted in decisive defeat
                    of one Govt division. We shall appreciate your comment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harriman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
